<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Best Learning Design Respects How Clinicians Actually Work</title>
    <style>
        /* Reset and base styles */
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        body {
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            width: 1920px;
            height: 1080px;
            overflow: hidden;
            position: relative;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        /* Background template */
        .shell {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 1920px;
            height: 1080px;
            z-index: 1;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        /* Content container */
        .content {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 1920px;
            height: 1080px;
            z-index: 2;
            padding: 140px 120px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        /* Typography */
        h1 {
            font-size: 76px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #0b1c2c;
            line-height: 1.15;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            max-width: 1500px;
        }
        .accent-line {
            width: 80px;
            height: 6px;
            background-color: #e31837;
            margin: 36px 0;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #475569;
            line-height: 1.4;
            max-width: 1400px;
        }
        /* Graphic container */
        .graphic-container {
            margin-top: 100px;
            width: 100%;
            flex-grow: 1;
            position: relative;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Required background template -->
    <img class="shell" src="../../../../templates/saem-annual-meeting-template-v1/template.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />

    <!-- Main content -->
    <div class="content">

        <h1>The best learning design respects<br>how clinicians actually work.</h1>

        <div class="accent-line"></div>

        <h2>Microlearning is not a shortcut. It is a better fit.</h2>

        <!-- Resolved Hero Graphic -->
        <div class="graphic-container">
            <svg width="1680" height="350" viewBox="0 0 1680 350" style="overflow: visible;">

                <!-- Background tracks (representing the noise/complexity that has been resolved) -->
                <line x1="0" y1="80" x2="1680" y2="80" stroke="#f1f5f9" stroke-width="2" />
                <line x1="0" y1="280" x2="1680" y2="280" stroke="#f1f5f9" stroke-width="2" />
                <line x1="0" y1="180" x2="1680" y2="180" stroke="#e2e8f0" stroke-width="2" />

                <!-- The main unified workflow line -->
                <line x1="100" y1="180" x2="1580" y2="180" stroke="#0b1c2c" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" />

                <!-- Node 1: Reach -->
                <g transform="translate(340, 180)">
                    <line x1="0" y1="-24" x2="0" y2="-100" stroke="#0055a5" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6" opacity="0.6" />
                    <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="22" fill="#0055a5" />
                    <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="40" fill="none" stroke="#0055a5" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.25" />
                    <text x="0" y="80" font-family="system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#0055a5" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="0.1em" text-transform="uppercase">REACH</text>
                </g>

                <!-- Node 2: Remember -->
                <g transform="translate(840, 180)">
                    <line x1="0" y1="-24" x2="0" y2="-100" stroke="#0b1c2c" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6" opacity="0.4" />
                    <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="22" fill="#0b1c2c" />
                    <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="40" fill="none" stroke="#0b1c2c" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.25" />
                    <text x="0" y="80" font-family="system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#0b1c2c" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="0.1em" text-transform="uppercase">REMEMBER</text>
                </g>

                <!-- Node 3: Use -->
                <g transform="translate(1340, 180)">
                    <line x1="0" y1="-24" x2="0" y2="-100" stroke="#e31837" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6" opacity="0.6" />
                    <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="22" fill="#e31837" />
                    <circle cx="0" cy="0" r="40" fill="none" stroke="#e31837" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.25" />
                    <text x="0" y="80" font-family="system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="26" font-weight="700" fill="#e31837" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="0.1em" text-transform="uppercase">USE</text>
                </g>

            </svg>
        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
